<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'PingFang SC' }}>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 64, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 21, fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>知迹 · 答辩汇报</Text>
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 1010, top: 21, width: 194, textAlign: 'right', fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF' }}>赛道十三 · 智慧教育</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 96, width: 1128 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>六个功能，一条主线</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10 }}>不是并列的功能清单——每一个都在把"今天的碎片"变成"期末能练的题"</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 190, width: 296, height: 462, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>主线</Text>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 12 }}>
      沉淀 → 复习
    </Text>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 10 }}>
      所有功能都服务这一个方向；没有一个是"顺便加的"。
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 22, gap: 16 }}>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', borderLeft: '2px solid #3D7BD9', paddingLeft: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>资料 → 片段</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 4 }}>秒传 · 懒解析 · 按页切块</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', borderLeft: '2px solid #3D7BD9', paddingLeft: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>片段 → 题</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 4 }}>错因驱动 · 变式题 · 详解</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', borderLeft: '2px solid #3D7BD9', paddingLeft: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>题 → 掌握度</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 4 }}>自评 · 间隔重复 · 薄弱学科</Text>
      </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 20, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>7</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568' }}>个功能页面</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>1</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568' }}>个 SQLite 文件承载全部数据</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 412, top: 190, width: 792, height: 470, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 64, background: '#F9FAFC', borderRadius: 6, paddingLeft: 14, paddingRight: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, borderRadius: 6, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', width: 208, marginLeft: 14 }}>多格式资料入库</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#4A5568', width: 500 }}>PDF / Word / PPT / Excel 秒传，解析后按页切块</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 64, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, paddingLeft: 14, paddingRight: 16, marginTop: 6 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, borderRadius: 6, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', width: 208, marginLeft: 14 }}>溯源问答</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#4A5568', width: 500 }}>四路召回 + RRF 融合，回答标注出自哪份资料哪一页</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 64, background: '#F9FAFC', borderRadius: 6, paddingLeft: 14, paddingRight: 16, marginTop: 6 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, borderRadius: 6, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>3</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', width: 208, marginLeft: 14 }}>图片板书入库</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#4A5568', width: 500 }}>拍照的板书由多模态模型转写成文字后入库，可被检索</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 64, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, paddingLeft: 14, paddingRight: 16, marginTop: 6 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, borderRadius: 6, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>4</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', width: 208, marginLeft: 14 }}>错题按类型归档</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#4A5568', width: 500 }}>概念混淆 / 步骤遗漏 / 条件误读 / 计算失误 / 表述不清</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 64, background: '#F9FAFC', borderRadius: 6, paddingLeft: 14, paddingRight: 16, marginTop: 6 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, borderRadius: 6, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>5</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', width: 208, marginLeft: 14 }}>变式题与详解</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#4A5568', width: 500 }}>由错因生成新题，作答后可看参考答案与关键步骤</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 64, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, paddingLeft: 14, paddingRight: 16, marginTop: 6 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, borderRadius: 6, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>6</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', width: 208, marginLeft: 14 }}>今日复习与日程</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#4A5568', width: 500 }}>到期题 / 薄弱学科 / 近期误区，再加"什么时候做"</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 36, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 6, marginTop: 8, paddingLeft: 16 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>
        六项功能共用一套数据：片段、题、掌握度——不是六个各自为政的小工具
      </Text>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, bottom: 24, width: 1128, height: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>知迹 · 基于大模型智能体的 AI 教育学习系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>05 / 10</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
